title: "Climate transition risk in the yield curve and in corporate credit spreads"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/pancakes9798/Climate-Risk-Project"
authors:
  - family-names: Migliaccio
    given-names: Emanuele
    affiliation: "Sapienza University of Rome"
keywords:
  - climate risk
  - term structure of interest rates
  - Nelson-Siegel
  - credit spreads
  - Shared Socioeconomic Pathways
  - copula
abstract: >-
  Projections of the US Treasury yield curve and of sector credit spreads to 2100 under the
  Shared Socioeconomic Pathways. A shifting-endpoint dynamic Nelson-Siegel model anchored to
  the natural rate of interest is combined with CDS-calibrated, Battiston-Monasterolo climate
  spreads and t-copula portfolio losses.
